        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Strike 1: Lead Prism = Insane basic buffs for that one turn, but also can end up a dead draw sometimes\nStrike 2: Decreasing your damage fo the turn is terrible\nStrike 3: There really is no upside to this\nStrike 4: Mei Lin loves this permanent buff, and its also an upgrade, so 5/5\nStrike 5: Has retain, can just sit in hand to deck thin, or be fodder for other effects\nNeutral Epiphany Draw is pretty good, but conditional like Strike 1"
          }
