            "en": "Snack 1: +-0 card, but usable twice so it's good for Glory Set\nSnack 2: +1 card, its the best version unless you have excess draw, or alot of basics that clog\nSnack 3: -1 Card in hand technically, but lets you deck thin by 3\nSnack 4: -0 Cards, but deck thins by 2 very good\nSnack 5: -1 Card, Deck thins by 3, and can tutor into itself to go again"
